Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 17:27:23 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Shell: Frost freeform glass via sibling blur underlay and BG
 blur.

Opaque app buffers cover leash backgroundBlurRadius; park a color-layer
underlay under the task instead, and honor window_blur_radius_unfocused.
